chived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-18T06:44:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T09:26:31Z","closed_at":"2026-02-20T03:49:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in `v4.4.1.stable.mono.official [49a5bc7b6]`\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS Sequoia 15.6.1\n\n### Issue description\n\n`Node.cs` has the following code:\n\n```cs\npublic StringName Name\n{\n    get\n    {\n        return GetName();\n    }\n    set\n    {\n        SetName(value);\n    }\n}\n\npublic void SetName(string name)\n{\n    NativeCalls.godot_icall_1_57(MethodBind2, GodotObject.GetPtr(this), name);\n}\n```\n\nAs a result:\n\n- Setting `Name = ACSharpString` will result in two allocations: `string` → `StringName` to use the property, then `StringName` → `string` to call `SetName`.\n- Setting `Name = AGodotStringName` will result in one allocation (`StringName` → `string` to call `SetName`).\n\n<img width=\"990\" height=\"297\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e03fdbf3-c9fd-4f6a-a3f0-0fefe1e4ff5e\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThis code:\n\n```cs\npublic partial class Main : Node2D\n{\n    private static readonly StringName CachedName = \"Hi\";\n\n    public override void _Process(double delta)\n    {\n        Name = CachedName;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nNotes:\n\n- I know this isn't something you should be doing in a hot path, but it seems like `SetName` should \\[be able to\\] take in a `StringName`.\n- It does seem like calling `SetName(\"Hi\")` does not cause an allocation (which surprises me 😮).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[SetNameRepro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25383766/SetNameRepro.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AdamLearns","id":60950402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTUwNDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60950402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamLearns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116426/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116426/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}